					<div class='gwd'><section class='final-cta'><div class='bg-mesh'><div class='blob blob1'></div><div class='blob blob2'></div></div><div class='wrap final-cta-in'><span class='kicker' style='color:var(--lime)'>Free audit · Abu Dhabi &amp; Al Ain</span><h2 style='margin-top:14px'>Find out how you look to Abu Dhabi clients <span style='color:var(--lime)'>in Arabic and in English</span></h2><p class='sub' style='margin:0 auto'>We check your Google Maps presence in both languages, your ads, your website and your reviews against the competitors in your area, and flag anything in your clinic ads that could cause trouble with DoH approval.</p><div class='hero-ctas' style='justify-content:center'><a href='/get-a-free-audit/' class='btn btn-grad'>Get My Free Abu Dhabi Audit</a><a href='https://wa.me/971588979925' class='btn btn-line'>WhatsApp Us (Arabic or English)</a></div><div class='trust-row'><span class='trust-item'><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='2'><rect x='3' y='11' width='18' height='10' rx='2'/><path d='M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4'/></svg>Confidential</span><span class='trust-item'><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='2'><path d='M18.36 5.64L5.64 18.36M12 2v2M12 20v2M2 12h2M20 12h2'/><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='6'/></svg>No Spam</span><span class='trust-item'><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='2'><path d='M20 12v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-6M12 15V3M8 7l4-4 4 4'/></svg>Free, no contract</span></div></div></section></div>				</div>
